  "prefLabel": "Saf-C 5605.03 Named Persons",
  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "Saf-C 5605.03 Named Persons.\n\n(a) In all instances in RSA 260:14, V(a) which require that a request be made for a \"named person's motor vehicle records\", the requestor must submit the following information for the person whose record is being requested:\n\n(1) The name of the person; and\n\n(2) The date of birth.\n\n(b) Notwithstanding (a) above, a request may be made based upon the vehicle registration or vehicle identification number if the requestor needs the information for purposes specified in RSA 260:14, V(a)(5).\n\nSource. #7361, EXEMPT, eff 9-1-00; ss by #7621, EXEMPT, eff 1-1-02; ss by #7626, EXEMPT, eff 1-17-02",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/saf-c5600.html"
}
